#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:180
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The chat, the solo arcade and this Help viewer share the same window manager. The Help viewer is laid out like the classic Windows Help: a toolbar (Back / Forward / Home), a navigator with Contents, Index and Search tabs, and a \"See Also\" list of related topics under each article."
msgstr "聊天、单人街机和本帮助查看器共用同一个窗口管理器。帮助查看器的布局类似经典的 Windows 帮助：一个工具栏（Back / Forward / Home），一个带有内容、索引和搜索标签的导航区，以及每篇文章下方的“See Also”相关主题列表。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3469
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Arcade Channels"
msgstr "街机频道"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3482
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every arcade game has a channel with its name, like %{channel}. When somebody starts the game, a bot says it there and in %{feed}."
msgstr "每款街机游戏都有一个以它命名的频道，例如 %{channel}。有人开始游戏时，机器人会在该频道和 %{feed} 中宣布。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3489
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The strip under the topic opens the game. The page of the game shows who played it."
msgstr "主题下方的栏条可打开该游戏。游戏页面会显示谁玩过它。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2356
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "2-minute rounds, best of 3. Missiles bounce off the first wall they hit. "
msgstr "每回合 2 分钟，三局两胜。导弹会从碰到的第一面墙上弹开。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3258
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
